"Tracing allows you to create logs of the calls to ODBC drivers. Great for "
"support people, or to aid you in debugging applications.\n"
"You must be 'root' to set"
msgstr ""
"「追蹤」讓您為 ODBC 驅動程式之取用建立記錄日誌。對支援人員很有用，或可助您為應用程式除錯。\n"
"只有「root」使用者可設定。"

